  m_text: "Scientists have discovered a red beam of light stretching out from our
    Sun. Within this beam, strange microbes were found feeding on the Sun\u2019s
    energy.\nBut they had one weakness: themselves. Whenever at least three of them
    were brought together, they annihilated each other.\n\nAnd now, you \u2014 a
    randomly selected human \u2014 must board a hastily built rocket with highly
    questionable safety standards and travel into the beam.\n\nYour mission is simple:
    combine them and destroy them.\n\nThe future of our world depends on you..."
